.SH NAME
md_frontend_2node__modules_2picomatch_2_c_h_a_n_g_e_l_o_g \- Release history 
.PP


.PP
\fBAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file\&.\fP

.PP
The format is based on \fRKeep a Changelog\fP and this project adheres to \fRSemantic Versioning\fP\&.

.PP
\fB\fBGuiding Principles\fP\fP
.PP
.PP
.RS 4


.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Changelogs are for humans, not machines\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
There should be an entry for every single version\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
The same types of changes should be grouped\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Versions and sections should be linkable\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
The latest version comes first\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
The release date of each versions is displayed\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Mention whether you follow Semantic Versioning\&.
.PP

.PP
.RE
.PP

.PP
\fB\fBTypes of changes\fP\fP
.PP
.PP
.RS 4


.PP
Changelog entries are classified using the following labels \fI(from \fRkeep-a-changelog\fP\fP):

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRAdded\fP for new features\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRChanged\fP for changes in existing functionality\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRDeprecated\fP for soon-to-be removed features\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRRemoved\fP for now removed features\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRFixed\fP for any bug fixes\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRSecurity\fP in case of vulnerabilities\&.
.PP

.PP
.RE
.PP
.SH "2\&.3\&.1 (2022-01-02)"
.PP
.SS "Fixed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixes bug when a pattern containing an expression after the closing parenthesis (\fR/!(*\&.d)\&.{ts,tsx}\fP) was incorrectly converted to regexp (\fR9f241ef\fP)\&.
.PP
.SS "Changed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Some documentation improvements (\fRf81d236\fP, \fR421e0e7\fP)\&.
.PP
.SH "2\&.3\&.0 (2021-05-21)"
.PP
.SS "Fixed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixes bug where file names with two dots were not being matched consistently with negation extglobs containing a star (\fR56083ef\fP)
.PP
.SH "2\&.2\&.3 (2021-04-10)"
.PP
